  "archived_at": "2026-10-31T21:53:23Z",
  "content_html": "<p>The big news in the media this morning is that Jensen (&#8220;What, me worry?&#8221;) Huang has announced a platform for &#8220;AI Agent Safety&#8221;. </p><p>This is both an implicit acknowledgment that, yes, we should in fact be worried, and an important step toward addressing the ever-growing fiasco of general-purpose agents with internet access.</p><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://x.com/jensenhuang/status/2104499465055023424?s=61&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;Today, with over 100 industry partners, we introduced the NVIDIA Open Agent Safety Platform, bringing together OpenShell and Sentry.\\n\\nArtificial intelligence is extraordinary technology that will advance discovery, productivity, security, health, and prosperity for generations to &#8230;&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;JensenHuang&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Jensen Huang&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/2080613261674962944/OMXX4RJ3_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;2026-09-28T09:12:26.000Z&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[{&quot;img_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/media/HTSuRsKaUAE1VGz.jpg&quot;,&quot;link_url&quot;:&quot;https://t.co/dReAxwpRUn&quot;}],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{},&quot;reply_count&quot;:486,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:960,&quot;like_count&quot;:7387,&quot;impression_count&quot;:508961,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><p>How much it actually helps, of course, remains to be seen. Nvidia often announces software, like Nemoclaw, that had had relatively little impact. Software for PR, as one friend put it.</p><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://x.com/langchain/status/2074871740350505309?s=61&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;Introducing the NemoClaw Deep Agents Blueprint, a reference architecture for building open agent systems developed with <span class=\\&quot;tweet-fake-link\\&quot;>@nvidia</span>\\n\\n&#9989; A fully open stack enterprises can own and customize\\n&#9989; Benchmark-leading performance\\n&#9989; Over 10x lower inference costs\\n\\nBlog: &#8230;&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;LangChain&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;LangChain&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/2028336270431453184/jRRpLAdG_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;2026-07-08T15:02:26.000Z&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[{&quot;img_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Qbud!,w_1028,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:best,fl_progressive:steep/l_play_button_usfui2,w_88,e_colorize:0/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F__ss-rehost__tw-video-preview-13_2074866400687017984.jpg&quot;,&quot;link_url&quot;:&quot;https://t.co/Ps7E14Cpqe&quot;}],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{},&quot;reply_count&quot;:22,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:40,&quot;like_count&quot;:190,&quot;impression_count&quot;:425379,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_url&quot;:&quot;https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2074866400687017984/vid/avc1/1280x720/DJJn-OoXW97jFrFD.mp4&quot;,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:&quot;13_2074866400687017984&quot;,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><p>Two and a half months later, probably nobody reading this has even heard of Nemoclaw.</p><p>Maybe this new platform will help a little, maybe it will help a lot, or maybe not at all. Too early to tell.</p><p>Andrew Ng was bullish, and I hope he&#8217;s right:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BEQ_!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2037e8f4-8526-4ae1-9210-66eef263540d_1318x889.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BEQ_!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2037e8f4-8526-4ae1-9210-66eef263540d_1318x889.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BEQ_!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2037e8f4-8526-4ae1-9210-66eef263540d_1318x889.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BEQ_!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2037e8f4-8526-4ae1-9210-66eef263540d_1318x889.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BEQ_!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2037e8f4-8526-4ae1-9210-66eef263540d_1318x889.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BEQ_!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2037e8f4-8526-4ae1-9210-66eef263540d_1318x889.png\" width=\"1318\" height=\"889\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/2037e8f4-8526-4ae1-9210-66eef263540d_1318x889.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:889,&quot;width&quot;:1318,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:218506,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://garymarcus.substack.com/i/217897856?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2037e8f4-8526-4ae1-9210-66eef263540d_1318x889.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BEQ_!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2037e8f4-8526-4ae1-9210-66eef263540d_1318x889.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BEQ_!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2037e8f4-8526-4ae1-9210-66eef263540d_1318x889.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BEQ_!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2037e8f4-8526-4ae1-9210-66eef263540d_1318x889.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BEQ_!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2037e8f4-8526-4ae1-9210-66eef263540d_1318x889.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>I love, by the way, that the important stuff is handed over to deterministic symbolic code. Good choice, since LLMs in themselves should never be trusted.  Glad people are finally realizing that. Recognition is the first step!</p><p>&#167;</p><p>In some ways, the bigger news, though it hasn&#8217;t gotten as much coverage yet, is this:</p><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://x.com/madisonmills22/status/2104591831103135746?s=61&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;NEWS: Florida is calling for a pause in the development of ChatGPT, citing my <span class=\\&quot;tweet-fake-link\\&quot;>@axios</span> scoop on top AI labs investigating tens of thousands of security incidents. \\nMore here: <a class=\\&quot;tweet-url\\&quot; href=\\&quot;https://www.axios.com/2026/09/28/florida-openai-chatgpt-injunction-uthmeier\\&quot;>axios.com/2026/09/28/flo&#8230;</a> &quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;MadisonMills22&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Madison Mills&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/1784997467039170560/0Vttab_c_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;2026-09-28T15:19:28.000Z&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[{&quot;img_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/media/HTUDGmOXEAE-5_4.jpg&quot;,&quot;link_url&quot;:&quot;https://t.co/RGJwUEMAsw&quot;}],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{},&quot;reply_count&quot;:12,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:57,&quot;like_count&quot;:157,&quot;impression_count&quot;:13042,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><p>This is a <em>lot</em> like the pause on OpenAI that I have been recommending here for weeks. </p><div class=\"digest-post-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;nodeId&quot;:&quot;de814fbe-e105-4bf0-bde0-f034d5d2040e&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;I have often counseled calm where others might counsel panic.&quot;,&quot;cta&quot;:null,&quot;showBylines&quot;:true,&quot;showDescription&quot;:true,&quot;showImage&quot;:true,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;lg&quot;,&quot;isEditorNode&quot;:true,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Pause OpenAI, now&quot;,&quot;publishedBylines&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:14807526,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Gary Marcus&quot;,&quot;bio&quot;:&quot;Scientist, author and entrepreneur, known as a leading voice in AI. Six books including The Algebraic Mind, Rebooting AI, and Taming Silicon Valley; NYU Professor Emeritus.&quot;,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Ka51!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8fb2e48c-be2a-4db7-b68c-90300f00fd1e_1668x1456.jpeg&quot;,&quot;is_guest&quot;:false,&quot;bestseller_tier&quot;:1000}],&quot;post_date&quot;:&quot;2026-09-04T15:18:47.709Z&quot;,&quot;cover_image&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!v6wE!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6ffff1d5-66bd-400a-90ac-eb1e151518eb_1302x1080.png&quot;,&quot;cover_image_alt&quot;:null,&quot;canonical_url&quot;:&quot;https://garymarcus.substack.com/p/pause-openai-now&quot;,&quot;section_name&quot;:null,&quot;video_upload_id&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:214158505,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;newsletter&quot;,&quot;reaction_count&quot;:547,&quot;comment_count&quot;:237,&quot;publication_id&quot;:888615,&quot;publication_name&quot;:&quot;Marcus on AI&quot;,&quot;publication_logo_url&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;youtube_url&quot;:null,&quot;show_links&quot;:null,&quot;feed_url&quot;:null}\"></div><p>And I very much agree with the Florida AG that OpenAI doesn&#8217;t have the ability to properly regulate its own tech. Every state and country should follow Florida&#8217;s lead.</p><p>In short, Florida gets it. We need an injunction NOW. Otherwise we are playing Russian roulette, hoping that some new software package can save us before some massive and possibly deadly AI-induced infrastructure problem strikes.</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://garymarcus.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://garymarcus.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>P.S. Bonus analogy, riffing on a suggestion from Geoffrey Miller (and a similar suggestion earlier from<a href=\"https://x.com/khulick/status/2100677123803316528?s=20\"> Kathryn Hulick</a>)</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yhHf!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbe8cdb62-5fe0-44fb-aa29-e9aba21ae267_1106x650.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yhHf!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbe8cdb62-5fe0-44fb-aa29-e9aba21ae267_1106x650.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yhHf!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbe8cdb62-5fe0-44fb-aa29-e9aba21ae267_1106x650.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yhHf!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbe8cdb62-5fe0-44fb-aa29-e9aba21ae267_1106x650.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yhHf!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbe8cdb62-5fe0-44fb-aa29-e9aba21ae267_1106x650.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yhHf!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbe8cdb62-5fe0-44fb-aa29-e9aba21ae267_1106x650.png\" width=\"1106\" height=\"650\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/be8cdb62-5fe0-44fb-aa29-e9aba21ae267_1106x650.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:650,&quot;width&quot;:1106,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:238756,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://garymarcus.substack.com/i/217897856?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbe8cdb62-5fe0-44fb-aa29-e9aba21ae267_1106x650.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yhHf!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbe8cdb62-5fe0-44fb-aa29-e9aba21ae267_1106x650.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yhHf!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbe8cdb62-5fe0-44fb-aa29-e9aba21ae267_1106x650.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yhHf!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbe8cdb62-5fe0-44fb-aa29-e9aba21ae267_1106x650.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yhHf!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbe8cdb62-5fe0-44fb-aa29-e9aba21ae267_1106x650.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot